            "title": "Full-scale Customization and Personalization",
            "text": "<p>We offer personalization services- from custom paint colors and upholstery, to logo placements on any French Fitness equipment. Whether you’re running a commercial gym, a government fitness facility, or simply want to have a uniform set of home gym equipment, we can do it all for you.</p>",
